{
  "bodyHash": "v7+6iRpOGQY=",
  "content": "<p><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/31qnTHav/images/9bcdf20013cd9ac82325a0b7c3540ddf05644af9.png\" alt=\"\"></p><p><a href=\"https://github.com/FaeWulf/Diversity\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/@intergrav/devins-badges@3/assets/cozy-minimal/available/github_vector.svg\" alt=\"github\"></a> <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/diversity\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/@intergrav/devins-badges@3/assets/cozy-minimal/available/curseforge_vector.svg\" alt=\"curseforge\"></a><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252ffaewufs-diversity\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/@intergrav/devins-badges@3/assets/cozy-minimal/available/modrinth_vector.svg\" alt=\"modrinth\"> </a><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252ffaewulf.xyz%252fdiscord%252f\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/@intergrav/devins-badges@3/assets/cozy-minimal/social/discord-singular_vector.svg\" alt=\"discord-singular\"></a></p><div><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fko-fi.com%252ffaewulf\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img alt=\"kofi-singular\" height=\"40\" src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/@intergrav/devins-badges@3/assets/compact/donate/kofi-singular_vector.svg\"> </a><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.paypal.com%252fpaypalme%252ffaewulf\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img alt=\"paypal-singular\" height=\"40\" src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/@intergrav/devins-badges@3/assets/compact/donate/paypal-singular_vector.svg\"></a></div><hr><h2>📖 模組概述</h2><p>Diversity 是一款為 Minecraft 增添多樣化功能的模組，從生活品質改善到新生物行為與隨機要素應有盡有。本模組也支援僅在伺服器端安裝運作。</p><p><strong>現有功能：68 項（最新版本新增1項）</strong></p><h3>2.4.0 版新增內容</h3><ul>\n<li>甘蔗現在可生長/種植於帶有 diversity:strong_support_sugarcane 標籤的方塊上，且不再需要鄰近水源。預設適用方塊：泥巴、泥濘紅樹林根</li>\n<li>現在需安裝 <code>Faewulf's Lib</code> 作為必要函式庫，造成不便敬請見諒</li>\n<li><code>烽火台擴展</code> 模組讓烽火台效果可超越4層！每多一層增加20格範圍，最高可達10層</li>\n<li>新增 <code>日夜計數器</code> 選項可調整晝夜更替速度（僅建議進階玩家調整）</li>\n<li>狐狸食用漿果後會自動繁殖</li>\n<li>新增兩種束口袋附魔：<code>真空吸取</code>（自動吸收背包內新拾取物品）與 <code>選擇性吸取</code>（僅吸收束口袋內已有物品）</li>\n<li>為 <code>望遠鏡生物辨識</code> 功能新增額外設定選項（偵測範圍、顯示資訊、距離、名稱）</li>\n<li><code>禁止鞍具生物遊蕩</code>（取代原 <code>禁止馴服馬匹遊蕩</code>）現在會影響所有可裝備鞍具的生物（支援模組生物）</li>\n</ul><h3>⚠️ 1.20.1 版本注意事項</h3><p>本模組原版為 1.21 設計，<code>1.20.1</code> 回溯版本將缺少以下功能且不計劃補回：</p><ul>\n<li>1刻延遲的銅燈方塊</li>\n<li>隨機尺寸的魚類</li>\n<li>縮小版蜜蜂</li>\n<li>錘子旋轉方塊功能</li>\n<li>自訂附魔需客戶端同步安裝（若需純伺服器端運作請關閉此功能）</li>\n</ul><p>&nbsp;</p><hr><h2>✨ 功能特色</h2><h3>額外合成配方</h3><p>束口袋合成</p><div class=\"spoiler\"><p><img src=\"https://github.com/FaeWulf/public-imgs/blob/main/mods/Diversity/recipes/bundleRecipe.png?raw=true\" alt=\"束口袋合成表\"></p></div><p>可疑的沙/礫石</p><div class=\"spoiler\"><p><img src=\"https://github.com/FaeWulf/public-imgs/blob/main/mods/Diversity/recipes/susSand.png?raw=true\" alt=\"可疑的沙\"><img src=\"https://github.com/FaeWulf/public-imgs/blob/main/mods/Diversity/recipes/susGravel.png?raw=true\" alt=\"可疑的礫石\"></p></div><p>&nbsp;</p><h3>生活品質改善</h3><p>&nbsp;1刻延遲銅燈（預設關閉）（僅限1.21）</p><div class=\"spoiler\"><p>使銅燈方塊如同快照版般僅有1刻延遲</p><p><a href=\"https://github.com/FaeWulf/public-imgs/blob/main/mods/Diversity/QoL/1tickdelayBulbBlock-min.gif?raw=true\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img style=\"display:inline-block\" src=\"https://github.com/FaeWulf/public-imgs/raw/main/mods/Diversity/QoL/1tickdelayBulbBlock-min.gif?raw=true\" alt=\"1刻延遲銅燈\"></a></p></div><p>備用附魔類型（1.21版僅伺服器端有效）</p><div class=\"spoiler\"><p>&nbsp;新增四種防護系附魔的弱化版本，效果相同但僅有原版25%強度</p><p><a href=\"https://github.com/FaeWulf/public-imgs/blob/main/mods/Diversity/QoL/backup_enchantment.png?raw=true\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://github.com/FaeWulf/public-imgs/raw/main/mods/Diversity/QoL/backup_enchantment.png?raw=true\" alt=\"備用附魔預覽\"></a> <a href=\"https://github.com/FaeWulf/public-imgs/blob/main/mods/Diversity/QoL/backup_enchantment-min.gif?raw=true\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img style=\"display:inline-block\" src=\"https://github.com/FaeWulf/public-imgs/raw/main/mods/Diversity/QoL/backup_enchantment-min.gif?raw=true\" alt=\"備用附魔演示\"></a></p></div><p>戰利品旗幟</p><div class=\"spoiler\"><p>&nbsp;新增類災厄旗幟的戰利品旗幟，可透過Boss掉落、牧羊人村民贈禮（村莊英雄狀態）等途徑獲得</p><p><img src=\"https://github.com/FaeWulf/public-imgs/blob/main/mods/Diversity/QoL/trophyBanner.png?raw=true\" alt=\"戰利品旗幟\"></p></div><p>束口袋附魔（1.21版僅伺服器端有效）</p><div class=\"spoiler\"><p>&nbsp;新增2種束口袋附魔（自動補充與容量擴充）。若客戶端同步安裝模組，物品欄位提示會正確顯示</p><p><img src=\"https://github.com/FaeWulf/public-imgs/blob/main/mods/Diversity/QoL/bundleEnchantment-min.gif?raw=true\" alt=\"束口袋附魔\"></p></div><p>強化附魔台</p><div class=\"spoiler\"><p>附魔台可偵測兩格外的書架，並能透過非實體方塊識別書架</p><p><img src=\"https://github.com/FaeWulf/public-imgs/blob/main/mods/Diversity/QoL/expandedEnchatingTable.gif?raw=true\" alt=\"擴展附魔台範圍\"></p></div><p>骨粉催生珊瑚</p><div class=\"spoiler\"><p>&nbsp;在溫暖海洋生態域中，可使用骨粉催生珊瑚扇與珊瑚方塊形成珊瑚礁</p><p><img src=\"https://github.com/FaeWulf/public-imgs/blob/main/mods/Diversity/QoL/bonemealCoral.gif?raw=true\" alt=\"骨粉催生珊瑚\"></p></div><p>骨粉催生小花</p><div class=\"spoiler\"><p>種植在菌絲土上的小花（除凋零玫瑰與火把花外）可使用骨粉使其擴散生長</p><p><img src=\"https://github.com/FaeWulf/public-imgs/blob/main/mods/Diversity/QoL/bonemealSmallFlower.gif?raw=true\" alt=\"骨粉催生小花\"></p></div><p>穿透牆上告示牌與物品展示框互動</p><div class=\"spoiler\"><p>當告示牌或物品展示框置於儲物箱、木桶或界伏盒上時，可手持物品直接右鍵開啟容器（蹲下仍可旋轉物品/編輯告示牌）</p><p><img src=\"https://github.com/FaeWulf/public-imgs/blob/main/mods/Diversity/QoL/clickThrough.gif?raw=true\" alt=\"穿透互動演示\"></p></div><p>日夜計數器</p><div class=\"spoiler\"><p>&nbsp;記錄遊戲內經過的天數</p><p><img src=\"https://github.com/FaeWulf/public-imgs/blob/main/mods/Diversity/QoL/day_counter-min.gif?raw=true\" alt=\"日夜計數器\"></p></div><p>深板岩生成器</p><div class=\"spoiler\"><p>&nbsp;在Y=8以下處，當岩漿與水接觸時會將石頭與鵝卵石轉化為深板岩</p><p><img src=\"https://github.com/FaeWulf/public-imgs/blob/main/mods/Diversity/QoL/deepslate_generator-min.gif?raw=true\" alt=\"深板岩生成\"></p></div><p>隱形物品展示框</p><div class=\"spoiler\"><p>&nbsp;對物品展示框潛行右鍵使用未染色的玻璃板可使其隱形。展示物品時保持隱形，空置時會顯示粒子效果作為提示</p><p><img src=\"https://github.com/FaeWulf/public-imgs/blob/main/mods/Diversity/QoL/invisibleItemFrame.gif?raw=true\" alt=\"隱形物品展示框\"></p></div><p>加速銅方塊氧化</p><div class=\"spoiler\"><p>銅方塊及其變種在雨水與水中會加速氧化</p><p><img src=\"https://github.com/FaeWulf/public-imgs/blob/main/mods/Diversity/QoL/fasterOxidization.gif?raw=true\" alt=\"加速銅塊氧化\"></p></div><p>加速礦車</p><div class=\"spoiler\"><p>&nbsp;鋪設在礫石上的鐵軌會使礦車及其變種行駛更快速</p><p><img src=\"https://github.com/FaeWulf/public-imgs/blob/main/mods/Diversity/QoL/fasterMinecart.gif?raw=true\" alt=\"加速礦車\"></p></div><p>發光莓果提供發光效果</p><div class=\"spoiler\"><p><img src=\"https://github.com/FaeWulf/public-imgs/blob/main/mods/Diversity/QoL/glow-berries_glow-min.gif?raw=true\" alt=\"發光莓果效果\"></p></div><p>界伏盒標籤顯示</p><div class=\"spoiler\"><p>&nbsp;放置的界伏盒會顯示其自訂名稱</p><p><img src=\"https://github.com/FaeWulf/public-imgs/blob/main/mods/Diversity/QoL/shulkerLabel.gif?raw=true\" alt=\"界伏盒標籤\"></p></div><p>可填充的空可疑沙/礫石</p><div class=\"spoiler\"><p>&nbsp;可透過潛行右鍵將物品放入空的可疑沙與可疑礫石中</p><p><img src=\"https://github.com/FaeWulf/public-imgs/blob/main/mods/Diversity/QoL/usableSusBlock.gif?raw=true\" alt=\"可疑沙/礫石填充\"></p></div><p>無經驗上限的鐵砧</p><div class=\"spoiler\"><p>&nbsp;移除鐵砧「過於昂貴」的限制。客戶端仍會顯示該提示但不影響實際功能</p></div><p>防止耕地踐踏</p><div class=\"spoiler\"><p>&nbsp;當實體（含玩家）穿著羽落靴或擁有緩降效果時，不會踐踏破壞耕地</p><p><img src=\"https://github.com/FaeWulf/public-imgs/blob/main/mods/Diversity/QoL/farmlandTrampling.gif?raw=true\" alt=\"防耕地踐踏\"></p></div><p>作物收穫經驗</p><div class=\"spoiler\"><p>收割作物時可獲得經驗值</p><p><img src=\"https://github.com/FaeWulf/public-imgs/blob/main/mods/Diversity/QoL/xpCrops.gif?raw=true\" alt=\"作物經驗\"></p></div><p>睡眠不設定重生點</p><div class=\"spoiler\"><p>&nbsp;潛行右鍵點擊床可跳過夜晚而不變更重生點</p><p><img src=\"https://github.com/FaeWulf/public-imgs/blob/main/mods/Diversity/QoL/skipSetSpawnPoint.gif?raw=true\" alt=\"睡眠不設重生點\"></p></div><p>火把點燃目標</p><div class=\"spoiler\"><p>&nbsp;當手持火把或靈魂火把攻擊時，可點燃目標生物</p><p><img src=\"https://github.com/FaeWulf/public-imgs/blob/main/mods/Diversity/QoL/torch_fire_attack-min.gif?raw=true\" alt=\"火把燃燒\"></p></div><p>（重製版）睡眠不跳過天氣（預設關閉）</p><div class=\"spoiler\"><p>睡眠不會清除天氣效果<br>RAIN_ONLY 模式僅保留降雨<br>ALL_WEATHER 模式保留降雨與雷暴（此模式下雷暴時無法入睡）</p></div><p>清洗已探索地圖</p><div class=\"spoiler\"><p>使用鍋釜清洗已探索的地圖</p><p><img src=\"https://github.com/FaeWulf/public-imgs/blob/main/mods/Diversity/QoL/washingFilledmap.gif?raw=true\" alt=\"清洗地圖\"></p></div><p>潛行穿越甜漿果叢</p><div class=\"spoiler\"><p>&nbsp;潛行狀態下穿越甜漿果叢不會受到傷害</p><p><img src=\"https://github.com/FaeWulf/public-imgs/blob/main/mods/Diversity/QoL/sneakingSweetBerry.gif?raw=true\" alt=\"潛行甜漿果\"></p></div><p>褲裝防護甜漿果</p><div class=\"spoiler\"><p>&nbsp;穿著褲子可防止甜漿果叢造成傷害</p><p><img src=\"https://github.com/FaeWulf/public-imgs/blob/main/mods/Diversity/QoL/sneakingSweetBerry.gif?raw=true\" alt=\"褲裝防護\"></p></div><p>加速玻璃/螢光石採集</p><div class=\"spoiler\"><p>&nbsp;鎬類工具可更快破壞玻璃類方塊與螢光石</p><p><img src=\"https://github.com/FaeWulf/public-imgs/blob/main/mods/Diversity/QoL/glassblockMining.gif?raw=true\" alt=\"加速採集\"></p></div><p>四元素畫作</p><div class=\"spoiler\"><p>&nbsp;四元素2x2畫作現可在生存模式中放置</p><p><img src=\"https://github.com/FaeWulf/public-imgs/blob/main/mods/Diversity/QoL/elementPaintings.png?raw=true\" alt=\"四元素畫\"></p></div><p>濕海綿在溫暖生態域自然乾燥</p><div class=\"spoiler\"><p>&nbsp;</p><p>放置在溫暖生態域的濕海綿會隨時間變回普通海綿</p><p><img src=\"https://github.com/FaeWulf/public-imgs/blob/main/mods/Diversity/QoL/wetsponge_dry_warmbiome-min.gif?raw=true\" alt=\"海綿乾燥\"></p></div><p>未定義</p><h3>物品調整</h3><p>束口袋放置方塊</p><div class=\"spoiler\"><p>手持束口袋時潛行左鍵地面切換至放置模式，可直接放置束口袋內的方塊</p><h3><img src=\"https://github.com/FaeWulf/public-imgs/blob/main/mods/Diversity/item/bundlePlaceBlocks-min.gif?raw=true\" alt=\"束口袋放置\"></h3></div><p>鋤頭範圍收穫作物</p><div<div class=\"spoiler\"><p>&nbsp;潛行時使用「剪刀」可扒竊村民。從正面扒竊極易激怒村民；從背後下手能降低風險，若搭配隱形藥水則可完全避免。每次扒竊都可能使村民職業重置，職業等級越高重置機率越低。</p><p><img src=\"https://github.com/FaeWulf/public-imgs/blob/main/mods/Diversity/item/pickpocketVillager.gif?raw=true\" alt=\"剪刀扒竊村民\"></p></div><p>&nbsp;</p><p>望遠鏡「那是什麼？」</p><div class=\"spoiler\"><p>&nbsp;用望遠鏡查看方塊/實體資訊（音符盒、生怪籠冷卻、紅石強度、熔爐經驗值...），預設偵測半徑5格，縮放時可延伸至32格</p><p><img src=\"https://github.com/FaeWulf/public-imgs/blob/main/mods/Diversity/item/spyglassWhatIsThat-min.gif?raw=true\" alt=\"望遠鏡HUD\"></p></div><p>時鐘顯示時間</p><div class=\"spoiler\"><p>手持時鐘可顯示當前世界時間</p></div><p>時鐘檢查村民行程</p><div class=\"spoiler\"><p>&nbsp;手持時鐘右鍵點擊工作站方塊，可查看村民工作行程</p><p><img src=\"https://github.com/FaeWulf/public-imgs/blob/main/mods/Diversity/item/clockCheckSchedule-min.gif?raw=true\" alt=\"時鐘行程表\"></p></div><p>三叉戟召喚雷暴（靈感來自Vanilla Tweaks的「引雷風暴」）</p><div class=\"spoiler\"><p>&nbsp;在最高Y層向天空投擲引雷三叉戟（耐久度＞50%）可召喚雷暴，作為代價三叉戟將失去引雷附魔與全部耐久（不會損壞）</p><p><img src=\"https://github.com/FaeWulf/public-imgs/blob/main/mods/Diversity/item/trident_call_thunderstorm-min.gif?raw=true\" alt=\"三叉戟召雷\"></p></div><p>上蠟方塊偵測器</p><div class=\"spoiler\"><p>&nbsp;潛行時手持望遠鏡，上蠟銅塊會顯示粒子效果</p><p><img src=\"https://github.com/FaeWulf/public-imgs/blob/main/mods/Diversity/item/waxBlockIndicator-min.gif?raw=true\" alt=\"蠟塊檢測\"></p></div><p>&nbsp;</p><h3>生物行為調整</h3><p>九命貓（預設關閉）</p><div class=\"spoiler\"><p>&nbsp;貓咪擁有九條命</p><p><img src=\"https://github.com/FaeWulf/public-imgs/blob/main/mods/Diversity/entity/9_lives_cat-min.gif?raw=true\" alt=\"九命貓\"></p></div><p>沉默命名牌</p><div class=\"spoiler\"><p>命名牌含「silent」或「shutup」可使生物靜音</p></div><p>幼體命名牌</p><div class=\"spoiler\"><p>命名牌含「baby」可阻止幼年動物成長</p></div><p>可刷毛的鸚鵡/雞</p><div class=\"spoiler\"><p>&nbsp;用刷子刷鸚鵡或雞會掉落羽毛</p><p><img src=\"https://github.com/FaeWulf/public-imgs/blob/main/mods/Diversity/entity/brushChickenParrot.gif?raw=true\" alt=\"刷鸚鵡/雞\"></p></div><p>爆炸嗅探獸</p><div class=\"spoiler\"><p>&nbsp;對嗅探獸使用粉末（火藥、烈焰粉、糖、紅石、螢石粉）會讓牠嗅聞然後...<br>「教育孩子別亂聞不明物質」<br>- Faewulf</p><p><img src=\"https://github.com/FaeWulf/public-imgs/blob/main/mods/Diversity/entity/ExplodeSniffer.gif?raw=true\" alt=\"爆炸嗅探獸\"></p></div><p>山羊掉落羊毛與羊肉</p><div class=\"spoiler\"><p>擊殺山羊會掉落羊毛與羊肉</p></div><p>苔蘚塊上的嗅探獸</p><div class=\"spoiler\"><p>&nbsp;嗅探獸在苔蘚塊上嗅聞會掉落孢子花/小懸葉草</p><p><img src=\"https://github.com/FaeWulf/public-imgs/blob/main/mods/Diversity/entity/snifferMossBlock.gif?raw=true\" alt=\"苔蘚塊嗅探\"></p></div><p>拍拍寵物</p><div class=\"spoiler\"><p>&nbsp;潛行+右鍵可與寵物互動（狼、貓、馬、鸚鵡）</p><p><img src=\"https://github.com/FaeWulf/public-imgs/blob/main/mods/Diversity/entity/patYourpets.gif?raw=true\" alt=\"拍拍寵物\"></p></div><p>狐狸埋藏物品</p><div class=\"spoiler\"><p>&nbsp;狐狸會將物品埋進沙礫或沙子中</p><p><img src=\"https://github.com/FaeWulf/public-imgs/blob/main/mods/Diversity/entity/foxBuryItems.gif?raw=true\" alt=\"狐狸埋物\"></p></div><p>迷你蜜蜂（僅1.21）</p><div class=\"spoiler\"><p>&nbsp;蜜蜂體型縮小為原本一半</p><p><img src=\"https://github.com/FaeWulf/public-imgs/blob/main/mods/Diversity/entity/smallerBee.png?raw=true\" alt=\"迷你蜂\"></p></div><p>隨機尺寸魚類/魷魚（僅1.21）</p><div class=\"spoiler\"><p>&nbsp;魚類與魷魚會隨機生成不同尺寸</p><p><img src=\"https://github.com/FaeWulf/public-imgs/blob/main/mods/Diversity/entity/randomSizeFishes.png?raw=true\" alt=\"隨機尺寸魚/魷魚\"></p></div><p>豬布林與金邊盔甲</p><div class=\"spoiler\"><p>&nbsp;豬布林將金邊盔甲視同金質盔甲</p><p><img src=\"https://github.com/FaeWulf/public-imgs/blob/main/mods/Diversity/entity/piglinGoldenTrim-min.gif?raw=true\" alt=\"豬布林與金甲\"></p></div><p>已馴養馬/驢/騾不亂跑</p><div class=\"spoiler\"><p>&nbsp;配戴鞍具的已馴養動物不會四處遊走</p><p><img src=\"https://github.com/FaeWulf/public-imgs/blob/main/mods/Diversity/entity/noWanderingTamedHorse.gif?raw=true\" alt=\"已馴養馬匹\"></p></div><p>馬/驢/騾乘船</p><div class=\"spoiler\"><p>&nbsp;馬、驢、騾與駱駝現在能乘船！</p><p><img src=\"https://github.com/FaeWulf/public-imgs/blob/main/mods/Diversity/entity/horseSitOnBoat.gif?raw=true\" alt=\"船上馬匹\"></p></div><p>乾草塊上的蛋消失後自動孵化</p><div class=\"spoiler\"><p>&nbsp;放置在乾草塊上的雞蛋消失時會嘗試孵化</p><p><img src=\"https://github.com/FaeWulf/public-imgs/blob/main/mods/Diversity/entity/eggOnGroundTryHatch-min.gif?raw=true\" alt=\"蛋消失孵化\"></p></div><p>兔子食用胡蘿蔔作物後可繁殖</p><div class=\"spoiler\"><p><img src=\"https://github.com/FaeWulf/public-imgs/blob/main/mods/Diversity/entity/rabbitAutoBreedWithCarrotCrops-min.gif?raw=true\" alt=\"兔子自動繁殖\"></p></div><p>&nbsp;</p><p>雪傀儡產生粉雪</p><div class=\"spoiler\"><p><img src=\"https://github.com/FaeWulf/public-imgs/blob/main/mods/Diversity/entity/snowGolemGivesPowderSnow.gif?raw=true\" alt=\"雪傀儡產粉雪\"></p></div><p>&nbsp;</p><p>流浪商人通報員&nbsp;</p><div class=\"spoiler\"><p>流浪商人出現時向玩家發送訊息</p></div><p>&nbsp;</p><h3>指令</h3><p>/slimechunkcheck &nbsp;(v2.1.0移除)</p><div class=\"spoiler\"><p>檢查當前區塊是否為史萊姆區塊</p></div><p>/emote</p><div class=\"spoiler\"><p>在聊天室發出喵叫、呼嚕聲或狗吠聲。靈感來自插件[PlayerMeowing](<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fplugin%252fplayermeowing\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://modrinth.com/plugin/playermeowing</a>)</p></div><p>未定義</p><h3>詛咒功能</h3><p>疏水鞘翅（預設關閉）</p><div class=\"spoiler\"><p>&nbsp;鞘翅在雨中或水中無法使用</p><p><img src=\"https://github.com/FaeWulf/public-imgs/blob/main/mods/Diversity/cursed/hydrophobic_elytra-min.gif?raw=true\" alt=\"疏水鞘翅\"></p></div><p>終界石是起司（預設關閉）（僅1.21）</p><div class=\"spoiler\"><p>你可以吃終界石 :)</p></div><p>幻翼生成條件反轉（預設關閉）</p><div class=\"spoiler\"><p>玩家連續跳過夜晚睡覺時會生成幻翼</p></div><hr><h2>⚙️ 使用方式</h2><p>客戶端：透過ModMenu存取設定介面</p><p>伺服器端：幾乎所有功能都可透過config/diversity.toml設定檔開關</p><p>&nbsp;</p><hr><h2>⚠️ 必要模組</h2><ul>\n<li>Fabric API</li>\n<li>Faewulf's Lib</li>\n<li>(選用)權限管理模組如「Luck Perms」</li>\n</ul><p>&nbsp;</p><hr><h2>🪧 權限系統</h2><p>⚠️ **注意！** 2.0.0版後將移除本權限系統，改採Minecraft內建權限等級。<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fminecraft.wiki%252fw%252fOps.json_format)\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">詳見此處</a></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>若在設定檔啟用「權限模式」（預設關閉），可透過任何權限管理模組控制功能。<br>\n*請注意：若啟用權限模式卻未安裝權限管理模組，本模組將無法正常運作。</p><p>目前僅有2項權限：</p><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>功能</th>\n<th>權限節點</th>\n<th>權限等級（2.0.0後）</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td>/emote</td>\n<td>diversity.emote</td>\n<td>1</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>/slimechunkcheck*</td>\n<td>diversity.slimechunkcheck*</td>\n<td>1</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\n<td></td>\n<td></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table><ul>\n<li>(*) v2.1.0移除</li>\n</ul><p>&nbsp;</p><hr><h2>🛠️ 相容性</h2><p>本模組設計與其他Fabric模組相容，若遇問題請至GitHub議題區回報</p><p>&nbsp;</p><hr><h2>👍 支援</h2><p>問題回報或功能建議請至GitHub議題頁，或加入Discord伺服器：<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252ffaewulf.xyz%252fdiscord%252f\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">連結</a></p><div><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fko-fi.com%252ffaewulf\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img alt=\"kofi-singular\" height=\"40\" src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/@intergrav/devins-badges@3/assets/compact/donate/kofi-singular_vector.svg\"> </a><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.paypal.com%252fpaypalme%252ffaewulf\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img alt=\"paypal-singular\" height=\"40\" src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/@intergrav/devins-badges@3/assets/compact/donate/paypal-singular_vector.svg\"></a></div><hr><h2>📜 授權</h2><p>可自由用於模組包，惟需標註原作者</p><p>未定義</p>",
